            "body": "@HaiShaw @BBuf this is a gfx950 DSA prefill fix, the context-parallel RoPE ordering was corrupting KV and garbling output. No conflicts, mergeable, but the pr-test suite is behind the run-ci label and I can't add that from my account. Could one of you drop a `/tag-and-rerun-ci` and take a review pass? cc @saienduri for the AMD runners. The reds right now are only the gate jobs, nothing test-level failed.\n",
